  "limitations": [
    "One visible full-body reaction per actor, root policy none; no reaction queue, blend ramps, additive or upper-body reactions.",
    "Reaction timelines carry cue blocks only and no cue is dispatched by presentation in this slice.",
    "The fixture reuses the existing attack clip as its flinch; no flinch clip or default Royal reaction content is shipped.",
    "All actors in a scene share the player rig and skin; a spawn point never respawns; hits do not check faction, so NPCs can hit each other; nothing regenerates Stamina yet.",
    "Scripted native commands and D3D12 form/rendering evidence, not physical pointer input, remote graphical timing/loss or multiplayer qualification.",
    "M4/M5 In progress; EOS blocked; M6-M9 not started; publication crash-recovery limits unchanged."
  ]
}
